       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DATEADD.
      * Adds a number of days to a date: LK-DATE and LK-RESULT are
      * YYYYMMDD, LK-DAYS may be negative.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-DAY-NUMBER PIC 9(7).
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-DATE   PIC 9(8).
       01 LK-DAYS   PIC S9(4).
       01 LK-RESULT PIC 9(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-DATE LK-DAYS LK-RESULT.
           COMPUTE WS-DAY-NUMBER = FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(LK-DATE).
           ADD LK-DAYS TO WS-DAY-NUMBER.
           COMPUTE LK-RESULT = FUNCTION DATE-OF-INTEGER(WS-DAY-NUMBER).
           GOBACK.
